1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,680
(Leonard:)Really?

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,910
(Leonard:)You're going to risk getting
sleepy in the middle of your

3
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:05,180
(Leonard:)thermodynamic
fluctuations seminar?

4
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:07,570
(Leonard:)You know what happens
when you yawn in public.

5
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:14,990
(Sheldon:)Everyone will see
my oddly shaped uvula.

6
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:18,030
(Leonard:)You don't want that, do you?

7
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,250
(Sheldon:)No.

8
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:26,100
(Sheldon:)But it's a shame our society
mocks the differently uvulated.

9
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:28,640
(Sheldon:)Who was at the door?

10
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,640
(Leonard:)Uh, building manager.

11
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,510
(Leonard:)They have to fix a pipe,

12
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:35,180
so the water'll be off
tomorrow from noon to 2:00.

13
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,710
(Sheldon:)That's unacceptable.

14
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:38,130
(Sheldon:)We're supposed to be
given written notice.

15
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:39,930
Well, no, it doesn't matter--
we'll be at work.

16
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:42,820
(Sheldon:)What if I spill tomato
soup on my shirt,

17
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,190
(Sheldon:)and have to come home to change,

18
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:46,560
(Sheldon:)only to find there's no water
for an enzyme soak?

19
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,660
(Leonard:)Bifurcated uvula, Sheldon!

20
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:51,560
(Sheldon:)I'll have the chicken noodle.
Good night!

21
00:00:55,820 --> 00:01:02,020
(Raj:)We're going
to have to be very quiet.

